page/67769971","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"So that is it then, the last picture inside the artificial pine forest. It was almost dark now as you can see in the background. The fencing for the spice gardens is starting to appear alongside, but we did not stop of course, as it was fenced off, and it was too dark and far away to photograph anything now anyway. We had already take pictures of a cardamom plant earlier. (Vagamon Hills, Kerala, India, Apr. 2016)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/shankaronline/28455330172/\">Piaggio Ape is king all over Kerala</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/77742560@N06\">shankar s.</a> from Dubai, united arab emirates","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]}}}}